      "text": "======================================================\n CORAM: HONOURABLE MR. JUSTICE SANDEEP KUMAR  ORAL ORDER 2 19-05-2023 Heard learned counsel for the petitioner and learned Additional Public Prosecutor appearing on behalf of the State.",
